                    "q": "(iii) The main cause of the increase in the amount of CO2 in the Earth's atmosphere is\n(a) Rapidly growing human population\n(b) Burning of a large number of fossil fuels\n(c) Increase in the number of industries\n(d) Decrease in the forested resources."
