                    "a": "(a) Reforming ✓\nReforming is the process of conversion of hydrocarbons (gasoline) with low octane rating into those with higher octane rating that can be used as fuel in an internal combustion engine. It is carried out under high pressure and temperature using a platinum catalyst.",
