                    "a": "The rms speed is v_rms = √(3kT/m) = √(3RT/M) = √(3P/ρ), where m is the mass of one molecule, M is the molar mass, and ρ is the density of the gas.",
                    "q": "Write the formula for the rms speed of gas molecules."
