                    "a": "(c) OR + NAND — An XOR gate can be written as X = (A + B)·(A·B)′: the OR of the inputs ANDed with the NAND of the inputs. (In full the combination also needs an AND gate to combine the OR and NAND outputs.)",
                    "q": "10. Which combination of logic gates is equivalent to an XOR gate?\n(a) AND + OR\n(b) NOT + NOR\n(c) OR + NAND\n(d) AND + NAND"
