                    "a": "(c) neutron — Mass number: 9 + 4 = 13 = 12 + A_x, so A_x = 1. Atomic number: 4 + 2 = 6 = 6 + Z_x, so Z_x = 0. The particle is 1_0n, a neutron.",
                    "q": "1. Identify particle x in the following nuclear reaction 9_4Be + 4_2He → 12_6C + x\n(a) Electron\n(b) proton\n(c) neutron\n(d) photon"
