                "a": "(i) ln y = sin x ln x\n(1/y)dy/dx = cos x ln x + sin x/x\ndy/dx = x^(sin x)(cos x ln x + sin x/x)\n(ii) ln y = ln x ln(sin^-1 x)\n(1/y)dy/dx = ln(sin^-1 x)/x + ln x/(sin^-1 x sqrt(1 - x^2))\ndy/dx = (sin^-1 x)^(ln x)[ln(sin^-1 x)/x + ln x/(sin^-1 x sqrt(1 - x^2))]\n(iii) ln y = (sin x + cos x)ln(tan^-1 x)\n(1/y)dy/dx = (cos x - sin x)ln(tan^-1 x) + (sin x + cos x)/((1 + x^2)tan^-1 x)\ndy/dx = (tan^-1 x)^(sin x + cos x)[(cos x - sin x)ln(tan^-1 x) + (sin x + cos x)/((1 + x^2)tan^-1 x)]\n(iv) ln y = cos x ln(ln x)\n(1/y)dy/dx = -sin x ln(ln x) + cos x/(x ln x)\ndy/dx = (ln x)^(cos x)[-sin x ln(ln x) + cos x/(x ln x)]\n(v) ln y = x ln x\n(1/y)dy/dx = ln x + 1\ndy/dx = x^x(1 + ln x)\n(vi) (sqrt(x^2 + 1) - x)(sqrt(x^2 + 1) + x) = 1\ny = ln((sqrt(x^2 + 1) - x)^2) = 2ln(sqrt(x^2 + 1) - x)\ndy/dx = 2(x/sqrt(x^2 + 1) - 1)/(sqrt(x^2 + 1) - x)\n= -[[2/sqrt(x^2 + 1)]]",
